{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/851578e5d73011e8b6afd1bcbbab3b99.avif?t=1772741035\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras_big/851578e5d73011e8b6afd1bcbbab3b99.avif?t=1772741035 width=800 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Heavy Morning is a narrative-driven adventure that takes you into the mind of a young woman struggling to face the day ahead of her. Waking up one morning, &quot;the character&quot; finds herself unable to leave the comfort of her bed. Your mission is simple yet profound: help her navigate the first 30 minutes of her day and make it to work on time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/fd77251f8d27654434397f249bbbe993.poster.avif?t=1772741035\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/fd77251f8d27654434397f249bbbe993.webm?t=1772741035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/fd77251f8d27654434397f249bbbe993.mp4?t=1772741035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But nothing is as easy as it seems. Every decision you make will shape her reality, guiding her through the simplest of tasks: getting out of bed, washing up, getting dressed, having breakfast, each one a battle against the mental barriers holding her back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/081988101ce37f08d5875b39f93013b6.avif?t=1772741035\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras_big/081988101ce37f08d5875b39f93013b6.avif?t=1772741035 width=800 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you are playing in the \u201cReality\u201d realm, you will have to investigate the behavioral patterns and the influence it has over the mental state of the character. Things like \u201cgetting out of bed\u201d will feel like a puzzle. Will you check social media or force yourself from bed? Is any of the previous choices a good one?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/3f3cd58f791a7f958001b9ed197cc80b.poster.avif?t=1772741035\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/3f3cd58f791a7f958001b9ed197cc80b.webm?t=1772741035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/3f3cd58f791a7f958001b9ed197cc80b.mp4?t=1772741035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your behavior and actions will determine if you continue with the rest of the day, or if your character gets stuck in a loop, repeating the day's events again, and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/58101721e1ab805d9927adde8d02404d.avif?t=1772741035\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras_big/58101721e1ab805d9927adde8d02404d.avif?t=1772741035 width=800 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting to the Mind Space is no easy job, but will allow you and your character to reflect in your choices and your life, confronting your thoughts and feelings that will allow you to return to \u201cThe Reality\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/b1aa2000a22f08d704fc92749ef592de.poster.avif?t=1772741035\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/b1aa2000a22f08d704fc92749ef592de.webm?t=1772741035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/b1aa2000a22f08d704fc92749ef592de.mp4?t=1772741035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Mind, you'll navigate mental blocks and puzzles created by thoughts, guided by Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT) techniques that you'll learn throughout your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/9a43068dd70242f8c170572998e6935d.avif?t=1772741035\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras_big/9a43068dd70242f8c170572998e6935d.avif?t=1772741035 width=800 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to confront your mind? Step into the world of Lucid and overcome obstacles, grow stronger, and embark on a journey of self-discovery and resilience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/a41882a0cfa255155465d9a98681f84e.poster.avif?t=1772741035\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/a41882a0cfa255155465d9a98681f84e.webm?t=1772741035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/a41882a0cfa255155465d9a98681f84e.mp4?t=1772741035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3509400?t=1772741035","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/6196330c2b3f32c7cb251113744dd55cc8fb3af2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772741035","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/ea0981d6e32d102b10cece217bd1e8cf3063c6d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772741035","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/ea0981d6e32d102b10cece217bd1e8cf3063c6d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772741035","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4059690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/851578e5d73011e8b6afd1bcbbab3b99.avif?t=1772741035\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras_big/851578e5d73011e8b6afd1bcbbab3b99.avif?t=1772741035 width=800 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Heavy Morning is a narrative-driven adventure that takes you into the mind of a young woman struggling to face the day ahead of her. Waking up one morning, &quot;the character&quot; finds herself unable to leave the comfort of her bed. Your mission is simple yet profound: help her navigate the first 30 minutes of her day and make it to work on time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/fd77251f8d27654434397f249bbbe993.poster.avif?t=1772741035\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/fd77251f8d27654434397f249bbbe993.webm?t=1772741035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/fd77251f8d27654434397f249bbbe993.mp4?t=1772741035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But nothing is as easy as it seems. Every decision you make will shape her reality, guiding her through the simplest of tasks: getting out of bed, washing up, getting dressed, having breakfast, each one a battle against the mental barriers holding her back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/081988101ce37f08d5875b39f93013b6.avif?t=1772741035\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras_big/081988101ce37f08d5875b39f93013b6.avif?t=1772741035 width=800 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you are playing in the \u201cReality\u201d realm, you will have to investigate the behavioral patterns and the influence it has over the mental state of the character. Things like \u201cgetting out of bed\u201d will feel like a puzzle. Will you check social media or force yourself from bed? Is any of the previous choices a good one?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/3f3cd58f791a7f958001b9ed197cc80b.poster.avif?t=1772741035\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/3f3cd58f791a7f958001b9ed197cc80b.webm?t=1772741035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/3f3cd58f791a7f958001b9ed197cc80b.mp4?t=1772741035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your behavior and actions will determine if you continue with the rest of the day, or if your character gets stuck in a loop, repeating the day's events again, and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/58101721e1ab805d9927adde8d02404d.avif?t=1772741035\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras_big/58101721e1ab805d9927adde8d02404d.avif?t=1772741035 width=800 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting to the Mind Space is no easy job, but will allow you and your character to reflect in your choices and your life, confronting your thoughts and feelings that will allow you to return to \u201cThe Reality\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/b1aa2000a22f08d704fc92749ef592de.poster.avif?t=1772741035\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/b1aa2000a22f08d704fc92749ef592de.webm?t=1772741035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/b1aa2000a22f08d704fc92749ef592de.mp4?t=1772741035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Mind, you'll navigate mental blocks and puzzles created by thoughts, guided by Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT) techniques that you'll learn throughout your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/9a43068dd70242f8c170572998e6935d.avif?t=1772741035\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras_big/9a43068dd70242f8c170572998e6935d.avif?t=1772741035 width=800 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to confront your mind? Step into the world of Lucid and overcome obstacles, grow stronger, and embark on a journey of self-discovery and resilience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/a41882a0cfa255155465d9a98681f84e.poster.avif?t=1772741035\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/a41882a0cfa255155465d9a98681f84e.webm?t=1772741035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/extras/a41882a0cfa255155465d9a98681f84e.mp4?t=1772741035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Saf Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509400/e29d89d72ad355e197bbf46b0f23fe4d21c46971/header.jpg?t=1772741035","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3509400/111492903/956d1f52d04c4d93d2504beefec7bc1a9d2d1ef6/1760395357/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760395865","dash_h264":"https:/